# Overnight Autonomous Projection, 07:30 AM CST Fresh-Pull & Live Email Dispatch Loop (`loop-me`)

## Loop Definition
A non-stop overnight engineering, ingestion, optimization, and stress-testing workflow (`22:00 CST` $\to$ `07:30 AM CST`) followed by a hard-gated **`07:30 AM CST` (`America/Chicago`) Fresh-Data Pull & Full From-Scratch Pipeline Execution** that makes the verified outputs live **strictly at or after `07:30 AM CST` (NEVER before `07:30 AM CST`)** and dispatches the complete morning intelligence, `200+` Pt DraftKings DFS lineup portfolio, and 360-degree full-board report to Garrett via email.

## Trigger
- **Continuous Overnight Loop (`Now -> 07:29 AM CST`):** Continuous multi-agent ingestion, AST equation compilation, 22-metric Positive-Part James-Stein + Ridge weight optimization, 9-model worker fleet stress-testing, and 10-charge regression sweeps every cycle all night long.
- **Hard Morning Execution Trigger (`07:30 AM CST` / `30 7 * * *` `America/Chicago`, `ExactTiming: true`):**
  - Strictly gated so **live data pull, final from-scratch production run, live deployment, and email delivery NEVER execute before `07:30 AM CST`**.

